  (text "Section 5 of the circuit notes. The diodes clip to ground after a series resistor, not in the feedback loop [1], [6]. D1, D2 and\nR6 are reported [6]\n(R6 is the 1 kOhm between the coupling capacitor and the diodes in the schematic). The DSP models the pair as a memoryless soft-\nknee\nlimit at 0.6 V (pk.kneeClip(0.6, 4), run at 4x; the level is inferred from silicon diodes, the hardness is chosen) and has no R6.\nC7 is the pedal's coupling capacitor [6]. The DSP has no DC, so it has no counterpart; its level-dependent corner is an open\nquestion." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8fcb13df-3110-5ec0-869e-ce27e3c0e12f"))
